The frontend-design skill in eirene/plugins/eirene-skills is adapted from the
frontend-design skill in anthropics/claude-plugins-official, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. It was modified for Eirene: the description, wording,
and guidance for existing products and screenshot tooling were changed.

The following bundles in eirene/plugins are adapted from third-party projects under
the MIT License. Each folder keeps its original LICENSE file.

- arena: from Jake Schincariol's arena-skill (github.com/Jakeschincariol/arena-skill,
  commit df07b8e), modified to run on Eirene's delegate_tasks with a smaller default.
- obsidian: from Steph Ango's obsidian-skills (github.com/kepano/obsidian-skills,
  commit 3ccff53), with a plugin manifest added.
- superpowers: from Jesse Vincent's Superpowers (github.com/obra/superpowers, commit
  22f0b46, version 7.0.2), modified for Eirene's tools. The diagnosing-superpowers
  skill and other hosts' files were removed, and the brainstorming server's remote
  logo was disabled.
